    "type": "game",
    "name": "Celestial Force: Magical Mayhem",
    "steam_appid": 2292180,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292180/extras/eeed3893b5bf9910292f2d8f17d611a9.poster.avif?t=1697735196\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292180/extras/eeed3893b5bf9910292f2d8f17d611a9.webm?t=1697735196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><strong>Celestial Force: Magical Mayhem is a beat'em up game where magical girls must defend the Earth from an alien invasion.</strong><br>The <strong>Celestial Force</strong> is being summoned to deal with the terrible <strong>Plutonians</strong> and prevent our planet from being taken by the forces of evil.<br><br>Help the girls to battle their enemies and free the city from the aliens nefarious influence. Choose your magical combatent to face the invaders using their elemental-adjacent powers and a lot of glitter!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT YOU CAN DO</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Choose your favorite Magical Girl with a unique combat style.<br></li><li>Play with a friend to beat the invaders.<br></li><li>Complete several events with different results.<br></li><li>Defeat powerful bosses.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292180/extras/918fe685a321238fa096e734d95f536f.poster.avif?t=1697735196\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292180/extras/918fe685a321238fa096e734d95f536f.webp?t=1697735196\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Two playable characters, for single player and local coop: Violetta and Atsuko.<br></li><li>Two complete levels, with their respective bosses.<br></li><li>8 different enemies, with 3 unique models.<br></li><li>2 bosses with models, animations and unique effects.<br></li><li>Hand-drawed in-game comics to tell the story from the point of view of each of the girls.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292180/extras/9c4dc3c069149f7022ac16e4a0ab65d0.avif?t=1697735196\" /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>New characters, with new combat styles and unique stories.<br></li><li>New levels, deepening the story in different scenarios.<br></li><li>New bosses, with unique designs and combat styles.<br></li><li>More events throughout the game.<br></li><li>Steam Achievements!<br></li><li>General improvements and bug fixes.</li></ul>",
