fects.<br></li><li>Hand-drawed in-game comics to tell the story from the point of view of each of the girls.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292180/extras/9c4dc3c069149f7022ac16e4a0ab65d0.avif?t=1697735196\" /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>New characters, with new combat styles and unique stories.<br></li><li>New levels, deepening the story in different scenarios.<br></li><li>New bosses, with unique designs and combat styles.<br></li><li>More events throughout the game.<br></li><li>Steam Achievements!<br></li><li>General improvements and bug fixes.</li></ul>",
